  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%9A%A9%EA%B6%81%EC%97%90%EC%84%9C-%EC%98%A8-%EC%86%90%EB%8B%98/2908), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/60746439)\n\n58 years ago, came up to Haeundae Beach\n\nThe sea turtle \"Gwiyoung\", who returned home after being welcomed by the citizens,\n\nGiving up his position as an iron rice cooker in the dragon palace, he came up to the human world to taste the dreamlike time of that time once again.\n\nHowever, Gwi-young goes through twists and turns due to the changed environment of the human world, and is frustrated by the news that her old friend \"Hyeon-soo\", whom she longed to see, has also passed away. Instead, he tries to have fun with his granddaughter, \"Yeon-soo\", but Yeon-soo has no time to enjoy life as she struggles to achieve her dreams with no one to turn to...\n\nGwi-young takes care of the training in his own way and tries to help and relax, but it only causes trouble and rather increases the burden of training. In the end, Yeon-soo tries to send such a troublemaker Gwi-yeong back to the sea...\n\nWill Gwi-young be able to fulfill his humble dream of spending quality time with the person he likes?",
